  description: "You can only use each of the following effects of \"Therion \"Reaper\"
    Fum\" once per turn.\r\n\u25CF You can target 1 \"Therion\" monster or 1 Aqua
    monster in your GY; Special Summon this card from your hand, and if you do, equip
    that monster to this card.\r\n\u25CF During your opponent's turn (Quick Effect):
    You can target 1 \"Therion\" card in your Spell & Trap Zone and 1 card your opponent
    controls; return them to the hand.\r\nA \"Therion\" monster equipped with this
    card gains 700 ATK, also it can activate the 2nd effect listed above as if it
    were \"Therion \"Reaper\" Fum\"."
